### Register New User
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/register/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "john_doe",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "phone_number": "+1234567890",
  "password": "SecurePass123!",
  "password2": "SecurePass123!"
}

### Obtain JWT Token (Login)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/token/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "john_doe",
  "password": "SecurePass123!"
}

### Refresh JWT Token
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/token/refresh/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh": "YOUR_REFRESH_TOKEN_HERE"
}

### Get User Profile (requires authentication)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/me/
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### Create Recycling Transaction
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transactions/create/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "material_type": "plastic",
  "item_code": "BOTTLE_12345",
  "machine_id": "MACHINE_001"
}

### Create Another Transaction (Different Material)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transactions/create/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "material_type": "aluminum",
  "item_code": "CAN_67890",
  "machine_id": "MACHINE_001"
}

### Try Duplicate Transaction (Should Fail)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transactions/create/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "material_type": "plastic",
  "item_code": "BOTTLE_12345",
  "machine_id": "MACHINE_001"
}

### List All User Transactions
GET http://localhost:8080/api/transactions/
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### Get User Statistics
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/me/stats/
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### Get Points History
GET http://localhost:8080/api/points/history/
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### Get Specific Transaction Details
GET http://localhost:8080/api/transactions/TRANSACTION_ID_HERE/
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
